[{"id":163875537,"discussion_id":"eaab55d984fe81037c5d65158477201898a1534a","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| posembedding | ✅ [*chen-linxin4*](https://gitcode.com/chen-linxin4), [*cc-z*](https://gitcode.com/cc-z) (2/2) | ✅ [*chen-linxin4*](https://gitcode.com/chen-linxin4), [*cc-z*](https://gitcode.com/cc-z) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-02-28T15:25:42+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-28T17:31:34+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163875566,"discussion_id":"fae5f575ba724dd25fecac949f1061cf0ee24e22","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-28T15:25:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-28T15:25:50+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163875582,"discussion_id":"db7b9003961729a77ae3b5e1995898a90752be36","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n weixin_44156099, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-02-28T15:25:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-28T15:25:52+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163875739,"discussion_id":"f8cca537a3a05c9e7537f8d17df64bab3f4e89b0","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在解决RoPE（Rotary Position Embedding）算子内核在特定计算流程中，向量计算单元（V）与内存传输引擎（MTE）之间可能存在的数据依赖问题。通过在关键路径上增加显式同步，确保在处理Key数据前，之前计算阶段的结果已完全就绪，从而避免潜在的竞态条件或数据不一致性，提升算子在异构计算环境下的稳定性和正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案聚焦于优化数据流同步。在`Compute`和`ComputeAlongHeads`两个核心计算函数中，分别在处理Key数据的关键路径上（调用`DataCopy`从全局内存加载数据之前），增加了`this->VToMTE2Sync()`调用。该操作强制等待向量计算单元（V）到内存传输引擎（MTE2）的数据搬运完成，确保后续的`DataCopy`操作能获取到正确的、已更新的中间数据，保证了复杂计算流水线中数据依赖关系的正确性。","created_at":"2026-02-28T15:26:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-28T15:26:35+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163876094,"discussion_id":"a50266b56b6a0b55e373aa04eb599ad907576d4c","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-02-28T15:28:14+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-28T15:28:14+08:00","user":{"id":"673d915b584fe8295cfdb199","login":"weixin_44156099","object_id":"673d915b